  "paper_id": "ccs-2023-nestfuzz-enhancing-fuzzing-with-comprehensive-understand-48dc907a",
  "title": "NestFuzz: Enhancing Fuzzing with Comprehensive Understanding of Input Processing Logic",
  "abstract": "Fuzzing is one of the most popular and practical techniques for security analysis. In this work, we aim to address the critical problem of high-quality input generation with a novel input-aware fuzzing approach called NestFuzz. NestFuzz can universally and automatically model input format specifications and generate valid input.",
